    control would be destroyed by your opponent's card effect, you can destroy this
    card instead of 1 of those cards. If you control a \"Solfachord\" card in your
    Pendulum Zone: You can Special Summon this card from your hand. You can only
    use this effect of \"ReSolfachord Dreamia\" once per turn."
